    "en": "The MUC house: the m6-1873 marriage of a Muc bride — KOLBEZEN h16 × MUC h10 the full double (P253!); the 52-year-old bride of 1874 = THE OLDEST OF THE PREHISTORY (P250!); 11 death blocks 04106 (1857–1885) — among the deepest death histories."
